# Exact state-machine counterpart to the Functional Delta scalar customer.

machine sum_to 2 n word acc word result word
local one word
local next word
local next_acc word
state check
brzero n done recurse
state recurse
const one 1
sub next n one
add next_acc acc n
call result sum_to 2 next next_acc
return result
state done
copy result acc
return result
end

machine main 0 result word
local five word
local zero word
state start
const five 5
const zero 0
call result sum_to 2 five zero
halt result
end

entry main start